@host = http://localhost:3000
@auth = Basic b3RvcnJlczpURVNUX1BBU1NXT1JE

### Health ping (public, no auth)
GET {{host}}/health

### Auth required — should 401 without credentials
POST {{host}}/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "hello.txt",
  "contentType": "text/plain"
}

### Step 1: request a presigned upload URL
# @name presign
POST {{host}}/documents
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "hello.txt",
  "contentType": "text/plain"
}

### Step 2: upload the file directly to S3 using the presigned URL
PUT {{presign.response.body.uploadUrl}}
Content-Type: text/plain

Hono makes RAG easy. The capital of demo-land is Honoville.

### Step 3: ingest the uploaded document (chunk -> embed -> store vectors)
POST {{host}}/documents/{{presign.response.body.documentId}}/ingest
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Step 4: ask a grounded question (streamed SSE answer)
POST {{host}}/chat
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What is the capital of demo-land?"
}

### Chat scoped to a single document
POST {{host}}/chat
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What is the capital of demo-land?",
  "documentId": "{{presign.response.body.documentId}}",
  "topK": 4
}

### List all ingested documents
GET {{host}}/documents
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Delete a document (removes vectors + S3 objects)
DELETE {{host}}/documents/{{presign.response.body.documentId}}
Authorization: {{auth}}
